        "title": "Title page",
        "headline": "Global Polycrisis: the connections that change everything.",
        "notes": "- Start the clock as you press into Scene 1.\n- Behind the title, ember pulses wander the map: crises spreading along its links. The close answers them with relief.\n\nKey facts:\n- The network behind the title is the map the whole talk builds: a qualitative synthesis of the research, not a model.",
